  "question": {
    "text": "Let $S_{n}=\\cot ^{-1} 2+\\cot ^{-1} 8+\\cot ^{-1} 18+\\cot ^{-1} 32+\\ldots \\ldots .$ to $n^{\\text {th }}$ term. Then $\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} S_{n}$ is",
